      "onset_criterion": "CUSUM change-point (Page 1954): slack 1.0 sigma, alarm 10.0 sigma of baseline deviation noise; onset = start of the alarmed excursion, accepted only when the deviation stays above the slack for 40% of the following 30 ms (spike guard)",
